OL,3,GNEWSACommunity rallies to find owner's
OL,4,Amissing python
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a missing python has
OL,7,Fthanked his local community for
OL,8,Frallying to help find his beloved pet.
OL,10,FJacob Edwards said his "bundle of joy"
OL,11,Fball python Xanthe escaped from his
OL,12,Fhome in Bretton, near Peterborough, on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FHe said he felt "quite guilty" after
OL,16,Fthe 4.5ft (1.4m) snake escaped through
OL,17,Fa small vent in the back of her
OL,18,Fenclosure overnight after he
OL,19,Faccidentally left his back door open.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
